Subject: Adapt original HOME layout resources to native byte order
Upstream-base: 2c5c51e483b652d178ef06a44b83b07a0f97d2a6

Convert authored BRLYT0.8 scalar/relative-offset records beneath the original
Layout::Build. Preserve original header predicates, block walk, constructors,
resource selection and ownership. Typed u32 colors use the canonical RGBA word
ABI; actual GXColor byte records remain unchanged. Add the existing native
C_MTXScale alias for original paired-single matrix calls. No HOME initialization
or successful readiness is supplied by this transport.

